4-(N,N-Dimethylamino)-2′,5′-dimethylbiphenyl.26 2-p-Tolylpyridine.35
Yield 91%. 1H NMR: δ 2.39 (s, 3H), 7.14−7.20 (m, 1H), 7.25 (d, J = 8.1
Hz, 2H), 7.65−7.69 (m, 2H), 7.88 (d, J = 8.4 Hz, 2H), 8.66 (dt, J = 1.2,
4.8 Hz, 1H). 13C NMR: δ 21.3, 115.5, 120.3, 121.9, 126.9, 129.6, 130.0,
136.8, 139.0, 149.7, 157.6.
